Access contract: no user must receive status 401 without next(). An authenticated user whose role is not in ["developer", "viewer"] must receive status 403 without next(). A user in that list must call next(). Only these users are in scope: no user, admin, developer, viewer. The caller uses requireRole(...allowedRoles) with that exact list.
